How the alien race attacked Earth and why.

<!-- cell: plot id="96b07979-7be6-4ce4-a6a4-fdb269f81466" title="How the war begun (low-level)" nodes="78f58d5c-7cbf-4703-b827-ac1e99484c51:62-71, 17407ff9-1ee0-48f6-9715-975d604056a3:73-83, 981dcaa2-1eec-4154-8f4f-691a8f6331e1:85-97, 026c4034-fdcd-4e06-a98b-02e1b975f6bc:99-112, 18fa90e9-d869-4af2-96f6-671e4141a51a:114-138, 1c1b9e2c-f93d-44d7-80c3-65a252c56c43:140-164, caaf77c9-54c7-4651-b27f-7b83af728116:166-199, 85a84899-678c-4bf5-a781-3c0929af8d4f:201-214, 902418fc-9e01-4c58-ba91-4da58e89d652:216-234, 2e8b2bb3-7a25-4f36-8bef-ec34721d75d2:236-269, 715999ae-42f2-4440-bc79-7fff0e43a5a2:271-323, 5d44d092-b857-4bd9-ae54-7cada30f2265:325-352, 42ddb454-8d5c-4712-ba8b-c1189c79bbc0:354-367, 45801474-bce9-4977-8b09-04568814c95d:369-393, dd589b4e-4c7a-4f4f-a9cb-404ec06ee196:395-403, 4b149bc0-f217-4ec1-a863-78ae85da52ba:405-408, 27e2080d-a10b-4c1e-a22f-f4bb52ee34b7:410-428" edges="8c1e507b-7ce0-4319-a470-d7db8470c2ab:78f58d5c-7cbf-4703-b827-ac1e99484c51>17407ff9-1ee0-48f6-9715-975d604056a3, 86e0c370-b499-448c-b32d-cbba25ee73bf:17407ff9-1ee0-48f6-9715-975d604056a3>981dcaa2-1eec-4154-8f4f-691a8f6331e1, 068c1b1c-69c1-4f29-b25e-e8bf05869287:981dcaa2-1eec-4154-8f4f-691a8f6331e1>026c4034-fdcd-4e06-a98b-02e1b975f6bc, a0d5f4a7-6bc0-4c39-baed-c52acb26a702:18fa90e9-d869-4af2-96f6-671e4141a51a>1c1b9e2c-f93d-44d7-80c3-65a252c56c43, 645bc048-2064-4d91-964f-1287cf09cfe5:1c1b9e2c-f93d-44d7-80c3-65a252c56c43>caaf77c9-54c7-4651-b27f-7b83af728116, 43cfa2dc-1c49-4629-918c-9e6c3c4d39ca:85a84899-678c-4bf5-a781-3c0929af8d4f>902418fc-9e01-4c58-ba91-4da58e89d652, 3429c43a-2bc8-4d47-9543-4a120028fac9:902418fc-9e01-4c58-ba91-4da58e89d652>2e8b2bb3-7a25-4f36-8bef-ec34721d75d2, 1819178c-df4a-4eb6-a648-f3d093f4ae79:2e8b2bb3-7a25-4f36-8bef-ec34721d75d2>715999ae-42f2-4440-bc79-7fff0e43a5a2, 9e195f4d-061f-41d5-aa19-8a436ea47aca:715999ae-42f2-4440-bc79-7fff0e43a5a2>5d44d092-b857-4bd9-ae54-7cada30f2265, 062d2ff2-c158-4457-9e8b-82138eede9e5:42ddb454-8d5c-4712-ba8b-c1189c79bbc0>45801474-bce9-4977-8b09-04568814c95d, aef24e87-32b6-45e9-b952-5b5a3c140425:45801474-bce9-4977-8b09-04568814c95d>dd589b4e-4c7a-4f4f-a9cb-404ec06ee196, d77fec95-e699-4225-99d7-80a20b962c1a:dd589b4e-4c7a-4f4f-a9cb-404ec06ee196>4b149bc0-f217-4ec1-a863-78ae85da52ba, 848d2734-d949-4487-8221-e0f393a4f777:4b149bc0-f217-4ec1-a863-78ae85da52ba>27e2080d-a10b-4c1e-a22f-f4bb52ee34b7, ae990dc0-412d-4a61-b053-a7efedcbe994:026c4034-fdcd-4e06-a98b-02e1b975f6bc>18fa90e9-d869-4af2-96f6-671e4141a51a, baf5d260-62b0-48b8-91d6-2fc57dce264c:caaf77c9-54c7-4651-b27f-7b83af728116>85a84899-678c-4bf5-a781-3c0929af8d4f, f350041c-4bf5-4924-98dc-681e0e3f11a9:5d44d092-b857-4bd9-ae54-7cada30f2265>42ddb454-8d5c-4712-ba8b-c1189c79bbc0" -->

The discovery of an alien object on Mars. The alien object on Mars alerts its race of it being attacked and requests assistance. The alien fleet arrives at Mars to help defend their fellow. The aliens fire on the ships in Mars orbit, preventing further damage to their fellow on Mars.

<!-- cell: markdown id="f86493b2-6e58-490b-b78d-990a288bcfe9" -->

# Why the object was on Mars

## High-level plot

1. An alien traveller's ship breaks down while it is passing through our solar system.

2. The ship crashes on Mars, and the traveller survives.

3. It buries itself in the rock to protect itself, calls home for help, and waits for its people to come and get it.

4. A human probe notices the fresh crater and comes to look.

## Low-level plot

1.1. The traveller is flying alone between two of its race's worlds, and its route passes through our solar system.

1.2. Near the outer planets, the ship's engine fails, and the ship starts to fall toward the inner planets.

1.3. The traveller steers toward the nearest solid world it can reach: Mars.

2.1. The ship hits Mars and breaks apart, leaving a fresh crater.

2.2. The traveller survives because its body is covered in a hard shell of minerals from its home world.

2.3. The ship is destroyed, and the traveller has no way to leave Mars.

3.1. The traveller digs into the rock under the crater, to shelter from the cold and the radiation.

3.2. It calls its people over its faster-than-light link and tells them it has crashed.

3.3. Its people tell it that a ship will come for it, but the nearest one is far away, so it must wait.

3.4. The traveller stays still in the rock to save its strength, and waits.

4.1. A human satellite orbiting Mars photographs a crater that was not there before.

4.2. Scientists on Earth send a probe to look at the new crater.

4.3. The traveller watches the probe land and scan the rock above it, and does not know what it is.

<!-- cell: plot id="46e44044-eaf4-4813-bbcb-524c73d9c6ac" title="Why the object was on Mars (high-level)" nodes="bf17e389-6bcb-4378-b31b-2f7e7556932e:438-451, 8a7e0f35-5bfc-421a-9eb9-d4d250e71d17:453-461, b556f930-3608-41f8-b03f-0e2ef2eef2a9:463-485, 96d9a8dc-6634-4281-9458-b5e35f0dcbdc:487-497" edges="6aa6bfbb-4a77-4d2f-b496-a39b46c77c31:bf17e389-6bcb-4378-b31b-2f7e7556932e>8a7e0f35-5bfc-421a-9eb9-d4d250e71d17, deb4bd90-cd30-4503-887b-324ce823f325:8a7e0f35-5bfc-421a-9eb9-d4d250e71d17>b556f930-3608-41f8-b03f-0e2ef2eef2a9, f0ce6d7e-ca86-40a4-a21a-1d005ba275de:b556f930-3608-41f8-b03f-0e2ef2eef2a9>96d9a8dc-6634-4281-9458-b5e35f0dcbdc" -->

How an alien traveller came to be buried on Mars.

<!-- cell: plot id="4aa4611e-e84a-4217-a3a0-e624f9c8207c" title="Why the object was on Mars (low-level)" nodes="d38d6101-47d6-4760-8364-079636d3f523:501-519, e85d9ddd-d671-4b85-90b5-30b7d4758cc0:521-538, cb2011c5-9273-44dc-b360-fd7b624c2ba9:540-551, 34a87055-ce99-4780-969b-5b1e7c0ed701:553-563, 04234b62-1988-4413-823e-abb6b08253fa:565-582, 51869a83-2aa2-4729-980c-83698d8683f8:584-596, 12732446-249c-47cd-a099-69f1328e6cbb:598-614, cca1297f-5b21-47d8-b31c-f494bd742d5e:616-629, 60f7909e-6f99-46e7-95ed-e93cf87110ad:631-652, 223f3e71-1efc-4f2d-93d7-0f9c9926bc6f:654-666, a9d2b9d0-e094-4000-8f9c-1800052bf46e:668-680, 2ab6d58d-8efc-4e92-840d-68bc8c16a9bd:682-693, f7350818-9be1-412e-a459-47578572b6f3:695-713" edges="09cfdbbe-a602-40b4-b677-1708182388d8:d38d6101-47d6-4760-8364-079636d3f523>e85d9ddd-d671-4b85-90b5-30b7d4758cc0, d943c41c-51e5-478a-8903-2797d186f800:e85d9ddd-d671-4b85-90b5-30b7d4758cc0>cb2011c5-9273-44dc-b360-fd7b624c2ba9, 9409aa01-2dd8-4a2d-8294-0001fc1f769d:34a87055-ce99-4780-969b-5b1e7c0ed701>04234b62-1988-4413-823e-abb6b08253fa, 74ab260e-836a-45a0-b599-0c34f3148991:04234b62-1988-4413-823e-abb6b08253fa>51869a83-2aa2-4729-980c-83698d8683f8, b44d3510-1fff-4e48-b7a3-427ee1b25e35:12732446-249c-47cd-a099-69f1328e6cbb>cca1297f-5b21-47d8-b31c-f494bd742d5e, 9c35a38a-e2fe-4505-93f7-bdd9b20e3ff5:cca1297f-5b21-47d8-b31c-f494bd742d5e>60f7909e-6f99-46e7-95ed-e93cf87110ad, 2f73ea77-7450-49e8-b686-4e284628628c:60f7909e-6f99-46e7-95ed-e93cf87110ad>223f3e71-1efc-4f2d-93d7-0f9c9926bc6f, 3cf9ff44-976a-4872-8077-6f39f00289f4:a9d2b9d0-e094-4000-8f9c-1800052bf46e>2ab6d58d-8efc-4e92-840d-68bc8c16a9bd, 5cf10985-a096-4585-9c33-20f600bfd5ed:2ab6d58d-8efc-4e92-840d-68bc8c16a9bd>f7350818-9be1-412e-a459-47578572b6f3, 21152573-bedd-4daf-939a-1ce669ca797f:cb2011c5-9273-44dc-b360-fd7b624c2ba9>34a87055-ce99-4780-969b-5b1e7c0ed701, 98be20f1-1cb9-4cfe-bf4b-390de0561180:51869a83-2aa2-4729-980c-83698d8683f8>12732446-249c-47cd-a099-69f1328e6cbb, fa7a8d39-e104-42b6-a1b1-a2e4b75d99a7:223f3e71-1efc-4f2d-93d7-0f9c9926bc6f>a9d2b9d0-e094-4000-8f9c-1800052bf46e" -->

The traveller's ship fails on its way through our solar system. The ship crashes on Mars and the traveller survives. The traveller hides in the rock and calls home. Humans notice the crater and send a probe.

<!-- cell: salient-concept id="8e8a6674-478c-419d-896c-90a260f85822" title="The traveller" words="050b7c47-f1d5-4cc9-be63-4f6dc4483660:17-29, 8a55b6b4-4676-4603-9027-9bd910fa6191:114-138, 3879704f-4731-49d0-9f0e-f680a210613e:140-164, 35e606b6-0b30-45aa-9de4-0e05d32a8cb5:179-186, 4872a531-a30f-434c-8343-9a8ca19e666f:453-461, da85a88b-5916-4a7f-a528-54dd680e4b18:463-485, 9d6aff30-a938-4c92-9006-611c124fe5e2:501-519, a339357e-3b3a-4347-b526-40f19904f238:565-582, f1c0d07d-a094-4bfa-b9fe-c2492fc1d807:584-596, 2ec5e2ea-5d65-4b89-91aa-62f844459daa:654-666, 7f14101d-6039-491e-b2aa-c90007cd6465:695-713" -->

A lone alien stranded on Mars after a crash, who only wants to survive until its people come for it. Hurt by beings it cannot understand, it calls for help.

<!-- cell: salient-concept id="5f9cd3d4-c51b-4dc6-bdc7-776861df77da" title="The alien race" words="07d7df7a-142f-49bd-8b74-195d2cf2156d:30-41, 4cbe19e8-cad8-480e-a0c8-9fed365054c5:187-199, b04e6690-be33-4edc-9167-3f4f88de4afc:369-393, ca4dd131-6d60-4eb5-94e6-66a6b74930bd:395-403, b4bacdaf-49e9-414e-a19b-3f6e9ac2f072:631-652" -->

A people who come for one of their own, and treat whoever is hurting it as the enemy.

<!-- cell: salient-concept id="c1bf1836-9a18-4db7-8df5-798d9b55fb73" title="Humanity" words="803e7f0f-3f7d-400b-8d23-a7ad1ee72e84:7-15, 0085edeb-7752-4c6a-89a8-97c8e0b69bb1:85-97, 931f009e-f61c-4da1-8a3c-cf27c0c4508e:99-112, a9fe2a9f-ea80-415c-8288-b465ac70392e:216-222, 17eaf369-53a9-40bc-9979-329c1dc15d35:325-352, e9a97711-44b1-4bc8-afbd-96ebbd53ee58:410-428, f32f9edc-865e-4ca2-a883-4282dfa2b992:682-693" -->

The side that hurts a living being without knowing it is alive, and then takes its people's arrival and strike for an attack.

<!-- cell: salient-concept id="832fea15-0d66-42e4-9299-35ef692642ee" title="The faster-than-light link" words="569dda37-7121-4712-9a0d-458a9673949a:166-178, a9f49cfd-bd85-4b39-b31f-bb5fecbac173:354-367, 6fa77257-6047-4989-a3cd-c11b5bccfe51:472-475, cc6220cb-9197-404f-affe-2b6137e4325e:616-629" -->

The traveller's only way to reach its people. Through it a stranding becomes a rescue, and an injury becomes a call to war.

<!-- cell: salient-concept id="581dedf1-c744-401f-85cb-26bc4bcb5532" title="Misunderstanding" words="740df94b-2aae-4663-9ba2-ff2792d8e26d:43-55, fdb3c91d-d018-4dc4-ab55-205746aecc8b:236-269, 8ff4d31c-27b8-4c48-91a9-97855bc1f273:308-323, 49537012-4c24-49f4-8f84-9e951585e187:380-393, 3f9ba1f4-9b3d-4f20-bc87-4f1c3b317dd1:418-428, 12a1da30-78cc-4958-941b-3cb3188066af:707-713" -->

Neither side can read the other, so each takes the other's actions for an attack.

<!-- cell: salient-concept id="2d8238ef-1765-48e7-b778-8d463b3d27df" title="War" words="d6c12376-13d3-4f79-9051-b363f68cf421:57-58, e0bef313-726c-4e9d-9674-1e23498ef86f:395-403, be31be95-c2dd-4501-b60e-a996d264d128:423-428" -->

How a war begins that no one meant to start.
